# Implementation Plan - Database Reset and Comprehensive Seeding

## Goal Description
Reset the database completely and seed it with a comprehensive dataset for "Ramzi Dalil". This includes creating a hierarchy of Activity -> Division -> Region based on Sonatrach's real-world structure, and generating 50,000 emission records across 10 years (2015-2024), along with base year data, goals, mitigation actions, and production data.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This operation will **DELETE ALL EXISTING DATA** in the database. Ensure this is the intended action.

